# 行尾与二进制属性
#
# 目的：仓库此前没有 .gitattributes，工作区整树是 CRLF、索引是 LF，导致
# `git status` 常年把 200+ 个文件报成"已修改"（内容 diff 为 0），真正的改动
# 淹没在噪声里。统一为：索引/仓库一律 LF，Windows 脚本按 CRLF 检出。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 工具链文件保持 CRLF（PowerShell 5.1 与 cmd 都能读 LF，但保持原生习惯）。
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.idsig binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.pdf binary
*.pyc binary
